  "note": "Municipal election at Warrenpoint, January 1926. Both wards were contested: five seats in East Ward and seven in West Ward. Six candidates for five seats. Over 93 per cent of the 357 electors polled. The News-Letter prints Slade 205 and Gray 190; the local report is followed here."
